# The same circlet, the same turn, activated with the 'a' command instead of
# the y menu. Read by tools/check_yuse_activate.sh, bd inc-azc.
#
# Player::ItemMenu (src/Player.cpp) has always asked the item for its qval, so
# this route prompted even while the y route did not. It is here to keep the
# two routes honest about each other: a "fix" that stopped asking would turn
# this half red.

@include acquire-blast-circlet.keys

a
@dump:activate-menu
@choose "Circlet of Blasting"
@dump:after-activate
